  "text": " Although I'm about to present the evidence that this is scientific fraud and pure disinformation, we should also be recognized that although this trial was funded by the National Institutes of Health, every single researcher reports multiple sources of funding from many pharmaceutical companies. These are highly conflicted researchers. The NIH and the funding of its research is completely under the influence of the pharmaceutical industry. There are decades of evidence to demonstrate and support this unfortunate reality. In order to understand this trial, you need to be aware of an extremely disturbing fact, which is that the principal investigator Susanna Nagy was on the NIH's COVID-19 treatment panel. She was part of the group that did not give a recommendation for Iver Mectin in early January of 2021. Two months later, she received a $155 million grant from the NIH. The NIH claims that her and her group were the only ones that met their criteria for funding. You should ask yourselves what that criteria was. Further, in her listed conflicts of interest, it is revealed that she has financial relationships with at least six pharmaceutical companies. The most disturbing is the fact that she receives stock options from Vir Biotechnology, the manufacturer of a direct competitor, Viver Mectin, which is Sotrovimab, the monoclonal antibody. To make things even worse, she also receives funds from Gilead, which manufactures Remdesivir. The second author on this trial, Dr. David Bolleware, has been implicated in numerous scientific frauds throughout COVID around hydroxychloroquine and Iver Mectin. His name appears everywhere as an author on numerous fraudulent trials, and he is consistently recruited by major media to give damning evidence against repurposed drugs like Iver Mectin and hydroxychloroquine. This is an example of a thoroughly corrupted scientist who is working in the service of Dr. Fauci, Dr. Collins, and the pharmaceutical industry. This is brazen scientific misconduct. We know it, we see it, and the reason why it matters is that people will die because they're going to continuously be told that an effective drug is not available.",
